WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.409 --> 00:00:04.059
Unit sixteen. Disease Outbreaks!

2
00:00:05.031 --> 00:00:10.320
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:13.915
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.965 --> 00:00:18.067
Today we learn about Disease Outbreaks. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:22.535
Outbreak. Say it with me. Outbreak!

6
00:00:26.002 --> 00:00:30.052
Epidemic. Say it with me. Epidemic!

7
00:00:33.582 --> 00:00:37.316
Pandemic. Say it with me. Pandemic!

8
00:00:40.814 --> 00:00:44.964
Surveillance. Say it with me. Surveillance!

9
00:00:48.462 --> 00:00:53.046
Contact tracing. Say it with me. Contact tracing!

10
00:00:56.548 --> 00:01:00.632
Isolation. Say it with me. Isolation!

11
00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:08.316
Vaccination. Say it with me. Vaccination!

12
00:01:11.808 --> 00:01:16.008
Communication. Say it with me. Communication!

13
00:01:19.495 --> 00:01:32.220
An outbreak can grow into an epidemic or pandemic. Surveillance, contact tracing, isolation, and vaccination control spread. Clear communication builds public trust.

14
00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:35.633
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:36.342 --> 00:01:41.399
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:41.449 --> 00:01:42.599
Pandemic!

17
00:01:43.773 --> 00:01:49.296
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.346 --> 00:01:50.662
Vaccination!

19
00:01:51.687 --> 00:01:57.775
Did you know? A pandemic is an epidemic that has spread across many countries or continents!

20
00:01:57.825 --> 00:02:00.044
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:01.162 --> 00:02:10.019
Think and answer. What is the difference between an epidemic and a pandemic?

22
00:02:10.069 --> 00:02:11.219
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:17.402
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:17.452 --> 00:02:20.161
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

